OL,3,ARocky Horror star Tim Curry's cause of
OL,4,Adeath revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish actor Tim Curry died of
OL,7,Fcoronary artery disease, his spokesman
OL,8,Fhas confirmed to the BBC.
OL,10,FThe Rocky Horror Picture Show star died
OL,11,Fin his Los Angeles home on 25 August,
OL,12,Faged 80.
OL,14,FIn addition to the heart condition,
OL,15,FCurry had a history of stroke and
OL,16,Fkidney cancer, which were significant
OL,17,Fconditions that contributed to his
OL,18,Fdeath, his spokesman said, citing a
OL,19,Fdeath certificate filed in Los Angeles
OL,20,FCounty.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
